{
    "title": "BoatUS - Boat Weather & Tides",
    "description": "Join over 600,000 satisfied boaters that don't leave shore without BoatUS every time they're on the water.\r\n\r\nThe FREE BoatUS app has more than 7000 four star reviews. Download today.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n# 24/7 towing assistance\r\n\u2022 TowBoatUS is the nation\u2019s largest network of on-water towers with more than 300 ports nationwide.\r\n\u2022 Just tap Call For A Tow to connect to our dispatch center 24/7.\r\n\u2022 When you use the app to call for a tow on the water or road, we\u2019ll know your location - thanks to your phone\u2019s GPS \u2013 and dispatch assistance to you quickly.\r\n\r\n# Boating forecasts\r\n\u2022 Check the current tides, weather and marine conditions on your local waterways or the forecasts for your favorite destinations for up to 5 days ahead of your trip.\r\n\u2022 Customize your experience by selecting your preferred tide and buoy stations.\r\n\r\n# Small craft advisories\r\n\u2022 See what small craft advisories are or will be effecting your area before getting out on the water.\r\n\r\n# Hurricane alerts\r\n\u2022 Subscribe to specific hurricane alerts and/or select a region to monitor.\r\n\r\n# BoatUS discount finder\r\n\u2022 Find local marinas, tackle shops, and boatyards that offer you savings and discounts for being a BoatUS Member. Save on dockage, fuel, repairs, and more. And when you arrive, use the app to display your membership card to receive your discount.\r\n\u2022 Locate West Marine stores, where BoatUS Members earn the highest level of loyalty rewards, plus TowBoatUS ports and life jacket loaner sites. Use the filters to adjust exactly what types of locations you want to see.\r\n\r\n# Manage your membership\r\n\u2022 Join, upgrade, or renew your membership right through the app.\r\n\r\n# Manage your insurance policy\r\n\u2022 BoatUS and GEICO boat policy holders can access your insurance card and policy details, see upcoming invoices, make payments, and even file a claim.\r\n\u2022 Not insured with BoatUS? Use the BoatUS app to get a quote on insurance offered by the boating experts.\r\n\r\n# Much more\r\n\u2022 Share your location, raft up anchorage or favorite fishing hole via Facebook, text or email.\r\n\u2022 We're always looking for feedback, please let us know what features you'd like to see!\r\n\r\n*About BoatUS*\r\n\u2022 BoatUS has been delivering time, money and lifesaving services to recreational boaters nationwide since 1966. We fight for your rights on Capitol Hill, provide water and road towing services, low-cost marine insurance, discounts at boating businesses nationwide, and more! For more information visit BoatUS.com to join over half a million Members that know it pays to belong. Call 800-888-4869 or visit BoatUS.com for additional information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join over 600,000 satisfied boaters that don&#39;t leave shore without BoatUS every time they&#39;re on the water.<br><br>The FREE BoatUS app has more than 7000 four star reviews. Download today.<br><br>Features include:<br><br># 24/7 towing assistance<br>\u2022 TowBoatUS is the nation\u2019s largest network of on-water towers with more than 300 ports nationwide.<br>\u2022 Just tap Call For A Tow to connect to our dispatch center 24/7.<br>\u2022 When you use the app to call for a tow on the water or road, we\u2019ll know your location - thanks to your phone\u2019s GPS \u2013 and dispatch assistance to you quickly.<br><br># Boating forecasts<br>\u2022 Check the current tides, weather and marine conditions on your local waterways or the forecasts for your favorite destinations for up to 5 days ahead of your trip.<br>\u2022 Customize your experience by selecting your preferred tide and buoy stations.<br><br># Small craft advisories<br>\u2022 See what small craft advisories are or will be effecting your area before getting out on the water.<br><br># Hurricane alerts<br>\u2022 Subscribe to specific hurricane alerts and/or select a region to monitor.<br><br># BoatUS discount finder<br>\u2022 Find local marinas, tackle shops, and boatyards that offer you savings and discounts for being a BoatUS Member. Save on dockage, fuel, repairs, and more. And when you arrive, use the app to display your membership card to receive your discount.<br>\u2022 Locate West Marine stores, where BoatUS Members earn the highest level of loyalty rewards, plus TowBoatUS ports and life jacket loaner sites. Use the filters to adjust exactly what types of locations you want to see.<br><br># Manage your membership<br>\u2022 Join, upgrade, or renew your membership right through the app.<br><br># Manage your insurance policy<br>\u2022 BoatUS and GEICO boat policy holders can access your insurance card and policy details, see upcoming invoices, make payments, and even file a claim.<br>\u2022 Not insured with BoatUS? Use the BoatUS app to get a quote on insurance offered by the boating experts.<br><br># Much more<br>\u2022 Share your location, raft up anchorage or favorite fishing hole via Facebook, text or email.<br>\u2022 We&#39;re always looking for feedback, please let us know what features you&#39;d like to see!<br><br>*About BoatUS*<br>\u2022 BoatUS has been delivering time, money and lifesaving services to recreational boaters nationwide since 1966. We fight for your rights on Capitol Hill, provide water and road towing services, low-cost marine insurance, discounts at boating businesses nationwide, and more! For more information visit BoatUS.com to join over half a million Members that know it pays to belong. Call 800-888-4869 or visit BoatUS.com for additional information.",
